From 18f63c46af9a9c1aa98285d50849e4804f0b77ad Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: AxelGalvez11 <axelgalvez1121@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 13 Jul 2026 18:41:59 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] feat(nemesis): in-app update notice + v0.1.0-beta.2
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- nemesis-update-check.ts: semver-lite compare + GitHub Releases latest-tag
  fetch. Fail-safe by design: unparsable versions are never newer, network
  errors return null, so failures can only suppress the banner.
- nemesis-update-banner.tsx: student-build floating card (bottom-right) when
  a newer release exists — Download opens the account-portal redirect URL in
  the browser, Later dismisses per-tag. Detection only; nothing self-installs.
- Mounted in desktop-controller overlays beside the consent gate.
- package.json: version 0.1.0-beta.2. ALSO INCLUDES the pre-existing
  uncommitted beta identity config beta.1 actually shipped with (appId
  com.enternemesis.desktop, GitHub publish target AxelGalvez11/nemesis-desktop,
  nemesis:// protocol, author, tsx test runner, THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES resource)
  so the shipped build config is finally reproducible from the repo.

Tests: nemesis-update-check.test.ts 8/8 green; npm run build clean.
